    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency.</strong> You gain proficiency with three different Artisan’s Tools of your choice from the Fast Crafting table.</p><p><strong>Discount.</strong> Whenever you buy a nonmagical item, you get a 20 percent discount on it.</p><p><strong>Fast Crafting.</strong> When you finish a Long Rest, you can craft one piece of gear from the Fast Crafting table, as long as you have the associated Artisan’s Tools and proficiency with them. The item lasts until you finish another Long Rest, when it falls apart.</p><table><caption>Fast Crafting</caption><thead><tr><th>Artisan’s Tools</th><th>Crafted Gear</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Carpenter’s Tools</td><td>Ladder, Torch</td></tr><tr><td>Leatherworker’s Tools</td><td>Case, Pouch</td></tr><tr><td>Mason’s Tools</td><td>Block and Tackle</td></tr><tr><td>Potter’s Tools</td><td>Jug, Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>Smith’s Tools</td><td>Ball Bearings, Bucket, Caltrops, Grappling Hook, Iron Pot</td></tr><tr><td>Tinker’s Tools</td><td>Bell, Shovel, Tinderbox</td></tr><tr><td>Weaver’s Tools</td><td>Basket, Net, Rope, Tent</td></tr><tr><td>Woodcarver’s Tools</td><td>Club, Greatclub, Quarterstaff</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-DHK7i2iQnYGCBd4u\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Add the crafted item from the dnd5e equipment yourself, and remove it after your next Long Rest; apply the discount when you buy.</p></section>",
